# Sunday

- pnpm + Turborepo monorepo. App lives in `apps/web` (`@sunday/web`).
- Shared analytics helpers: `@sunday/analytics` (PostHog + Sentry wrappers).
- Public site must stay privacy-safe: brand **Sunday** only — no real name, employers, school, or private email.
- Canonical URL: `https://sundaydev.vercel.app` (`site.url`).
- i18n: `next-intl`, `/en` default, `/zh` alternate. Messages in `apps/web/src/messages/`.
- Contact form: Zod + Sonner + Turnstile + rate limit; keep terminal UI (avoid stock shadcn form skins).
- Supabase: `supabase/schema/messages.sql` + RLS contract in `supabase/README.md` (anon INSERT-only).
- Quality gates: `pnpm check`, `pnpm test:e2e`, `pnpm test:lighthouse` (after build), `pnpm analyze`.
- Before Next.js API changes, read `apps/web/node_modules/next/dist/docs/`.
